        <p>Suspect your Kidneys—so are Dropsical</p>
        <p>Swellings, Rheumatic Pains, Gravel,</p>
        <p>and Bladder Weakness.</p>
        <p>Every Picture</p>
        <p>When she can't work—can't eat—can't sleep—</p>
        <p>When her head is bad—her heart bad—</p>
        <p>feels weak, nervous and irritable—</p>
        <p>It is a warning that the kidneys are not : doing their duty--=they are leaving kidnt*- poisons in the blood, and these poisons are spreading disease to all parts of the system. Dropsy, stone, inflammation of the bladder, and urinary stoppage, as well as rheumatjsm, lumbago, and sciatica, 'arise from the same cause., Your neiNlibour tells here how Doan's Backache Kidney Pills help—speaks to you from personal .e.Aperience.</p>
        <p>It is just sucli, honest, heartfelt testimony as this that has established so much conh- dance in Doan's Backache Kidney Pills here.</p>
        <p>WARRINGTON PROOF.--</p>
        <p>Mrs. C. Lear lives at 11, Tanners-line, close to the Wesleyan Church, Warrington. She says :—" J was suddenly taken one day, about twelve months age, with terrible pains in my side and in the small of my back. They were like rheumatism, and affected me in the joints of my legs, which were quite stiff. "I was ill for a month, and found it</p>
        <p>Any Stubborn Pain in the Back is Good Cause to</p>
        <p>REPORT FROM A WARnimeSTORI PATIEFAT.</p>
        <p>tells a Story."</p>
        <p>When a Woman's back aches from morning to night—</p>
        <p>When she has dizzy spells and bearing-down pains, and</p>
        <p>almost imposaible to straighten my back after stooping; I could not go about my work. I could get no ease in any position, and found it was a hard matter to turn. over in bed. There were pains in my head, and I used to come over dizzy. • "The, .urinary system _was out of order; there was a constant desire for relief, espe- cially during the—night-time, and I passed many a restless night itt, consequence the - water was scanty., "Just at this time I decided to try Dean's Backache Kidney Pills. I got some, and from the first they did me good. After a short course of the pills I could get about and do my work with ease; all the pains had passed away and the water trouble was corrected. The pills improved my appetite, and altogether r felt like a new woman.</p>
        <p>"I think Doan's pills are champion, and I am pleased to recommend the . medicine. (Signed) "C. Lear."</p>
