        <p>Mrs. McDonald had nothing to saY, answer to the charge replied "That's She was committed for trial to the Livel` Assizes. Of' The police had no objection to bail, ally. lawful husband himself appeared as Wet° g° The Clerk: Ara the brothers willing bail? il The answer being in the affirmative, 101 granted in two sureties of .ClO each.</p>
