      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-10-25_WidnesExaminer_art0127" n="art0127">
        <head>DO YOUR NERVES TROUBLE</head>
        <p>DO YOUR NERVES TROUBLE</p>
        <p>YOU LIKE THIS?</p>
        <p>Graphic Description by a Man who found New Strength in Dr. Williams' Pink Pills.</p>
        <p>The following description of his nervous affliction by Williams Hanson, of 16, Peel-street, Lincoln, is especially important, as it indicates clearly the dif- ferent stages by which nervous exhaustion pro- ceeds to a complete and dangerous breakdown; on the other hand, no better - proof could be required of how promptly nervous ills are banished by tho new, rich blood supplied by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills.</p>
        <p>Mr. ,llanson states: " Some time ago I suffered from severe nervous exhaustion. At first I turned dizzy and queer when stooping over my work. Then I found that my memory was fail- ing, and often enough- I could not collect my thoughts. If anyone spoke to me suddenly I seemed quite upset. Different tonics were tried. but my nerves lave way completely. One .doctor said that I was suffering from severe nerr vous debility, but I did not seem to get any help from medicine.</p>
        <p>"As time passed I got worse, and had awful nights—full of dreaming and restlessness. Then , I got up in the mornings feeling an utter wreck. I rested from work, but grew worse, and began to feel so depressed and melancholy that I thought I should have to throw up my situation. My appetite was fair, but I never felt much better for what I was able to eat. "I had been in this state a year when a relative gave me a box of Dr. Williams' Pink Pills to try. These Pills made such an improve- ment iil my appetite and digestion that I decided to 'persevere. My food doing me more good helped matters a lot. Then I had more restful nights, and my 'nerves grew steadier. Soon I lost all dizziness, and 'my memory became reliable. "In time Dr. Williams' Pink Pills strength- ened me, and completely cured my nervous troubles. Like most men I occasionally get run- down, but a few doses of Dr. Williams' Pink Pills bring back my good form again." BOOK FREE. Nervous men shodY Dr. Williams' Medicine Co.</p>
