        <p>WELL-FED CHICKENS in the country, which they are now offering dressed to order, along with their DELICIOUS CREAM, NEW MILK, FRESH BUTTER &amp; EGGS. Prices and Particulars can be obtained at THE CREAMERY, BRIDGE STREET, WARRINGTON</p>
