        <p>• ill St. Teresa's, Irlam.—A supper and social.tee connection with the Young Ladies' Co took place on Saturday in the choolroom, ley-road. After supper a concert was given-iv the members and friends, and a most enjoYll') evening was spent. rtf , United Methodist, Irlam.—A children's was held on Saturday, in the schoolroom, pool-road. After tea, singing and garnes ifidulged in, and a most pleasant evening . brought to a close with a few remarks fr° .r Miss Ml6keve, of Urmston.</p>
