        <p>By 44 Scrum."</p>
        <p>have received. All the four fumbled the ball abouf n a:mpst hopeless inalmer. There is no doubt that 'some drastic change will have to be made amongst the threequarters if games are to be won. The art of passing needs also to be firmly taught. It has been a weakness all the season, and it was more in evidence than before in Saturday's match.</p>
